  "summary": "A bridge-type scraper reclaimer recovers bauxite from a blending stockpile across its whole cross-section. A harrow rakes the pile face so material slides down to a chain scraper at the pile foot, which drags it onto the yard conveyor. Reclaiming the full face blends the many stacked layers into a uniform feed.",
